# Do not use this file directly for environment plans.
# Copy one of these committed, sanitized examples to a local ignored .tfvars file:
#
#   cp staging.tfvars.example staging.tfvars
#   cp production.tfvars.example production.tfvars
#
# Then replace placeholder domains, hosted zone ids, certificate ARNs, and emails locally.
# Production additionally requires alarm_destination_confirmed=true and
# budget_destination_confirmed=true after both destinations are monitored.
# Real *.tfvars files are ignored by git. Do not commit account ids, emails, or secrets.
#
# Phase 8 expects separate plans:
#
#   terraform plan -var-file staging.tfvars
#   terraform plan -var-file production.tfvars
